{"product_id":"sofia-khan-is-not-obliged-a-heartwarming-romantic-comedy","title":"Sofia Khan is Not Obliged: A heartwarming romantic comedy","description":"\u003cp\u003e'Brilliant idea! Excellent! Muslim dating? Well, I had no idea you were allowed to date.' Then he leaned towards me and looked at me sympathetically. 'Are your parents quite disappointed?'Unlucky in love once again after her sort-of-boyfriend\/possible-marriage-partner-to-be proves a little too close to his parents, Sofia Khan is ready to renounce men for good. Or at least she was, until her boss persuades her to write a tell-all expose about the Muslim dating scene. As her woes become her work, Sofia must lean on the support of her brilliant friends, baffled colleagues and baffling parents as she seeks stories for her book. But in among the marriage-crazy relatives, racist train passengers and polygamy-inclined friends, could there be a lingering possibility that she might just be falling in love?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Ayisha Malik\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781785770036\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 464\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45684545192089,"sku":"3RB9781785770036","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68af37e349bb8_Sofia_Khan_is_Not_Obliged-_A_heartwarming_romantic_comedy_Ayisha_Malik.jpg?v=1756577624","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/sofia-khan-is-not-obliged-a-heartwarming-romantic-comedy","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}